**Ensemble tilt:** defensive/beta signals ≈ 70% of weight vs momentum 30% — appropriate for a bifurcated regime with commodity/crypto drawdowns while US equity trend holds. Directions = sign(IC); weights = |IC|×|ICIR| normalized (quality_ic_tilt).

### Risk Notes
