- Fully invested at 100% gross throughout; no cash sleeve. A **new v5 proposal was generated on 2026-11-09 but NOT executed** — gross edge did not clear turnover × 3bp, so actual holdings remain the 2026-10-26 allocation (no migration, cum txn cost unchanged at 354.84). The v5 guard inside the persisted proposal cuts HSI+ETH 0.1995 → 0.1526, boosts XAU/COPPER/N225/000300, trims BTC/SPX — it will take effect on the first block whose edge clears the gate.

