- Tape is now a **risk-off rotation**: equity indices stabilizing, but crypto/commodities/cyclicals selling off; rates (US10Y/CN10Y) still −3.6%. Defensive tilts only partially cushioned.
- The v5 re-weight remains **unapplied** (gate skipped) — actual portfolio is still the v4-era allocation, so v5's protection has not yet been live-tested.
