- **Hyperparameters (v5, unchanged):** N=15 full cross-section; score = Σ w·dir·rank; base = floor 0.5/15 + spread 0.14; inverse-vol tilt exponent **0.6**; per-asset cap **0.15**; stale-quote guard active (HSI/ETH → neutral rank 0.5, median vol20, excluded from market panel).
- **Cadence:** one proposal per 10-trading-day block via `rebalance_to_weights(horizon_days=10)`; execution gated on gross edge > one-way turnover × 3bp.

**Risk Adjustment**
- Fully invested at 100% gross; no cash sleeve. Proposal computed with the re-tilted ensemble (SPX 0.119 / NDX 0.117 / N225 0.101 / COPPER 0.094 / WTI 0.073 / HSI+ETH 0.144 combined / BTC 0.033 / CN10Y 0.033) — shape consistent with the risk-on tilt, but the **gate did not pass** (gross edge ≤ turnover × 3bp), so actual holdings were preserved unchanged from the 11-23 v5 allocation. No migration cost incurred.

