- v5 60-day backtest (2026-09-14 → 2026-12-04): Total Return **−1.59%**, Sharpe **−0.69**, MaxDD **8.24%**, gross 100%. Weaker than prior blocks (−0.27% last cycle), but the window spans the Sep–Nov risk-off tape; backtest remains a weak signal here. Ensemble set/directions unchanged, v5 just had its first positive live block → validated, no code change.

**Execution Results (step ×1, 2026-12-07 → 2026-12-21)**
- Period Return **+0.60%** (MaxDD 0.89%, Sharpe 2.6, gross 100%) — **second consecutive positive block** (+3.41% prior).
