2 A) drift re-validation of 4 active library factors (full + recent250/500)
3 B) new batch H candidates (fresh ideas, low overlap with batch G/E/F):
4    - risk-adjusted / smoothed trend: mom20_skip5_voladj, mom60_skip20, ma_dist_20, win_rate_60, stoch_pos_20
5    - reversal: gap_rev_10d, low_prox_20, high_breakout_20
6    - vol regime: vol_ratio_10x60, skew_60d
7    - liquidity: amihud_20d, volume_mom_20x60
8    - cross-asset/macro betas: dxy_beta_60d, usdjpy_beta_60d, vix_beta_60d, vix_up_beta_60d,
9      wti_beta_60d, xau_beta_60d, btc_beta_60d, downup_beta_60d, corr_dxy_60d, corr_vix_60d
10    - re-check batch G passers that were NOT persisted: mom_20d_skip5 (IC 0.0595/ICIR 0.1661), mom_20d
11 
12 Gate: |IC| >= 0.0070 and |ICIR| >= 0.0840 at h=10 (15-asset cross-asset universe, min_valid=8).
13 Robustness: full-period + recent250/500; report frozen (HSI/ETH flat since 2026-10-14).
